  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "營建法規與實務",
    "sub_ename": "CONSTRUCTION CODE AND PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "營建法規是國家考試之重要考科與範圍內容，也是在產業服務必須熟知的專業知識，學習本課程可兼顧考試、升學與業界用的多元效益。本課程內容範圍涵蓋規劃、採購、施工與營運等面向法規，並輔以實務案例作研討。",
    "describe_eh": "Construction Code is an important subject and scope of the Professional and Technical Examinations, which is also a professional knowledge that must be familiar with in industrial service. This course covers the multiple benefits of examination, further education and industry use. The content includes planning, procurement, construction and operation regulations, that is also supplemented by practical cases for discussion.",
